Package: fruitArchitecture
Title: Reconstruction and Quantification of Higher-Order Signaling Architectures
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(
      given = "Franklin T.",
      family = "Johnson",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "replace-with-your-email@example.com"
    )
Description: Reconstructs annotation-derived signaling modules, pairwise
    interfaces, and higher-order organizational architectures from
    transcriptomic differential-expression results. The package provides
    architecture classification, weighted interface symmetry metrics,
    balance and entropy statistics, permutation-based Level 3B testing,
    robustness summaries, and publication-quality visualizations.
